      "text": "[9:51PM] #Mile12 #TrafficUpdate \n\nGood traffic movement from Iyana School to Kosofe and Mile 12. \nSmooth ascending and descending on Mile12 Bridge towards Owode Elede, Owode Onirin, and the Weighbridge. \nBetter movement from Weigh Bridge to Idera, Irawo, Thomas, Ajegunle, and down to Odo Ogun. \nReturn journey is relatively calm with no reported impediments.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
